    "Source and oracle-target preparation only: no model responses, activations, probes or decoded graphs.",
    "Adaptive discovery bank, not confirmatory evidence or qualification of a new model family.",
    "Copy-only programs with four scalar variables and one final query, v0; no broad query replication.",
    "Canonical destination order is fixed: four initializations followed by v0, v1, v2, v3 copies.",
    "Numeric draws and lexical forms repeat a topology; they are not independent graph replications.",
    "Equal numeric states may occur across components; structural components, not numeric uniqueness, define the split.",
    "All oracle values, versions, dependencies, topology and counterfactual labels are targets, never readout features.",
    "Full-program oracle targets include future information; a prefix study must mask unseen definitions and output relevance.",
    "Syntactic ancestry and functional intervention effects are distinct; descendants can later be overwritten.",
    "Prepared structural targets only: no learned relationship decoder, activation analysis, model query or causal intervention. Each graph uses only visible assignment versions; the output expression is absent unless explicitly visible at the final checkpoint. Relations are syntactic def-use, strict ancestry and version succession, not numerical equality, functional influence or evidence that a model represents these relationships. Support/prior summaries weight structural groups equally after deduplicating graph states within each group; numeric and naming relatives are not independent replications. Fixed or one-class labels can make later decoding trivial. Graph variation alone does not qualify captures, independent generalization, an ownership mechanism or mechanism C.",
    "Source and oracle numeric controls only; no model responses, activations, training or decoded relations.",
    "Discovery preparation, not confirmatory evidence, independent seed replications or new-family qualification.",
    "The body only copies values; a+b=c is a relation among initial literals, not an arithmetic execution task.",
    "One final v0 query, fixed canonical destination order, neutral names and four scalar variables only.",
    "The 81 routing graphs are reused from the structural bank; numeric strata do not add new topologies.",
    "All strata, numeric draws, lexical forms and first-copy rewirings stay in their structural component.",
    "Distinct-uniform draws may accidentally satisfy a+b=c; stratum membership is generator metadata, not an exhaustive algebraic label.",
    "Equal numeric states may recur across components; numeric rows are not independent graph replications.",
    "Oracle traces, values, answers, topology, strata and numeric draws are targets, never readout features.",
    "Full-program oracle targets contain future information; prefix labels must hide future assignments and output relevance.",
    "Disjoint full graphs do not imply disjoint visible-prefix graphs or prove relational information is encoded.",
    "Prepared numeric oracle targets only; no decoder, activations, model response or new model query. Only current values after each visible assignment are used; hidden outputs, future assignments and output relevance are excluded. Equality/order and additive/subtractive identities are boolean tasks; signed difference is a separate numeric regression target. Constant/all-false boolean cells can be solved by a trivial prior and do not establish a useful decoding task. Each structural group has equal weight after deduplicating current numeric states within that group; numeric/naming relatives are not independent replications. A later direct relation probe must be compared with relations derived from independently decoded values. Relation recovery alone cannot establish a dedicated relational code, causal use, ownership or mechanism C. Numeric oracle values and all relations here are TARGETS, not readout/prediction features."
